---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { buildBreadcrumbJsonLd, buildPersonJsonLd } from "../../../utils/blog";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About | Le_Gaucher, A Left-Hander's Blog"
  description="Who is Le_Gaucher? A 19-year-old computer science student, chess player at 1,600 Elo, and author of a blog crossing neuroscience, psychology and chess strategy."
  canonicalPath="/en/about/"
  lang="en"
  frPath="/fr/about/"
  enPath="/en/about/"
  structuredData={[
    buildBreadcrumbJsonLd([
      { name : "Home", path : "/en/" },
      { name : "About", path : "/en/about/" },
    ]),
    buildPersonJsonLd("en"),
  ]}
>
  <article class="about-page">
    <img class="about-page__glyph" src="/images/logo.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />

    <section class="about-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="about-hero__grid">
          <div class="about-hero__avatar-block">
            <img
              src="/images/logo.svg"
              alt="A Left-Hander's Blog logo"
              class="about-hero__avatar"
              width="160"
              height="160"
              loading="eager"
            />
            <a
              class="about-hero__avatar-tag about-hero__avatar-tag--link"
              href="https://www.chess.com/member/le_gaucher"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              aria-label="Le_Gaucher's Chess.com profile (opens in a new tab)"
            >
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="about-hero__avatar-piece">♞</span>
              Le_Gaucher
              <svg
                class="about-hero__avatar-arrow"
                aria-hidden="true"
                width="10"
                height="10"
                viewBox="0 0 12 12"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.8"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              >
                <path d="M3 9L9 3M9 3H4M9 3V8" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="about-hero__text">
            <span class="eyebrow about-hero__eyebrow">About</span>
            <h1 class="about-hero__title">
              One guy, one <span class="about-hero__title-em">blog</span>,
              <br />and a methodical obsession for&nbsp;chess.
            </h1>
            <p class="about-hero__lead">
              I'm <strong>19 years old</strong>. I'm left-handed, not
              metaphorically, actually. That's where the site's name comes from.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <dl class="about-stats">
          <div class="about-stats__item">
            <dt>age</dt>
            <dd>19</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="about-stats__item">
            <dt>Rapid Elo</dt>
            <dd>1&thinsp;600</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="about-stats__item">
            <dt>playing chess</dt>
            <dd>3 years</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="about-stats__item">
            <dt>writing</dt>
            <dd class="about-stats__place">solo</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="about-stats__item about-stats__item--wide">
            <dt>based in</dt>
            <dd class="about-stats__place">Gosier, Guadeloupe</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="about-section__head">
          <span class="about-section__num">01</span>
          <h2 class="about-section__title">Why this blog exists</h2>
        </header>
        <div class="about-section__body">
          <p>
            At 16, I was asked to lead a chess club. Problem : I didn't have the
            level to do it. So I learned fast (very fast) absorbing everything
            I could about the game, the strategies, the psychology behind it.
          </p>
          <p>
            That pattern-based learning, I found it everywhere in my life since.
            I solve equations mentally. I read situations quickly. Chess didn't
            make me smarter , 
            <em>it gave me a method</em>.
          </p>
          <p>
            Later, I was writing articles on Chess.com. At least 1,000 views per
            article, without ever appearing in the official recommendations. The
            best unranked French-language blogger on the platform, in a way. I
            ended up deleting everything to avoid plagiarism and to build
            something that truly belonged to me.
          </p>
          <p class="about-section__close">This site is that.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section about-section--quote">
      <div class="container">
        <blockquote class="about-quote">
          <p>
            Who am I to talk technique to people who've been playing for thirty
            years? On the other hand, crossing chess with what research actually
            says: about memory, the brain, the psychology of the player , 
            that I can do rigorously.
          </p>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="about-section__head">
          <span class="about-section__num">02</span>
          <h2 class="about-section__title">What you'll find here</h2>
        </header>
        <div class="about-section__body">
          <p>
            I'm not a grandmaster. I'm not a neuroscience researcher. I'm a guy
            who reads the studies, checks the sources, and makes them accessible
            to everyone.
          </p>
          <p>
            The articles here are long. The summaries are detailed. The sources
            are cited. It's not an accident : it's an editorial line.
            <strong>You come here for an answer, you leave with an answer.</strong>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="about-section__head">
          <span class="about-section__num">03</span>
          <h2 class="about-section__title">How I work</h2>
        </header>
        <div class="about-section__body">
          <p>
            Every article starts with serious research:
          </p>
          <ul class="about-method">
            <li>
              <span class="about-method__tag">research</span>
              <span>Google Scholar, Google Academic, scientific databases accessible via my university license.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="about-method__tag">filtering</span>
              <span>Consensus AI to identify robust studies and rule out isolated conclusions.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="about-method__tag">writing</span>
              <span>I proofread myself. I correct. I cite my sources at the bottom of every article.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="about-method__tag">team</span>
              <span>One person, from start to finish. No freelancing, no ghostwriting.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section about-section--neg">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="about-section__head">
          <span class="about-section__num">04</span>
          <h2 class="about-section__title">What this blog <em>is not</em></h2>
        </header>
        <ul class="about-not">
          <li>
            <span class="about-not__mark">×</span>
            A classical chess lesson site.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="about-not__mark">×</span>
            A chess.com / chess24 news blog.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="about-not__mark">×</span>
            A place where I'll tell you what you want to hear, if a study is
            nuanced, I say so.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="about-not__mark">×</span>
            An aggregator of angles already covered a hundred times. I look for
            what no one has seriously tackled.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-signoff">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="about-signoff__inner">
          <p class="about-signoff__signature">
            <span class="about-signoff__name">Le_Gaucher</span>
            <span class="about-signoff__city">Gosier, Guadeloupe</span>
          </p>
          <p class="about-signoff__contact">
            For questions, exchanges, or to disagree:
            <a href="mailto:contact@blogdungaucher.com" class="about-signoff__mail">
              contact@blogdungaucher.com
            </a>
          </p>
          <p class="about-signoff__contact about-signoff__contact--chess">
            And if you want to play or see how I play:
            <a
              href="https://www.chess.com/member/le_gaucher"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="about-signoff__mail"
            >
              chess.com/member/le_gaucher
              <svg
                class="about-signoff__ext"
                aria-hidden="true"
                width="11"
                height="11"
                viewBox="0 0 12 12"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.8"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              >
                <path d="M3 9L9 3M9 3H4M9 3V8" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* ─── Fond + signature glyph ────────────────────────────────── */
  .about-page {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 0 0 5rem;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 50% at 90% -5%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--green) 8%, transparent), transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at -10% 60%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--green) 5%, transparent), transparent 55%),
      var(--bg);
  }

  .about-page__glyph {
    position: absolute;
    top: 8rem;
    right: -3rem;
    width: clamp(20rem, 38vw, 36rem);
    height: auto;
    opacity: 0.07;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
    transform: rotate(-4deg);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-page__glyph {
    opacity: 0.1;
    filter: invert(1);
  }

  .about-page > section {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* ─── HERO ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .about-hero {
    padding: calc(var(--navbar-h) + 2.5rem) 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-hero__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .about-hero__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.25rem;
      text-align: left;
    }
  }

  .about-hero__avatar-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
  }

  .about-hero__avatar {
    width: clamp(112px, 14vw, 160px);
    height: clamp(112px, 14vw, 160px);
    object-fit: contain;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: filter 260ms ease;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-hero__avatar {
    filter: invert(1);
  }

  .about-hero__avatar-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    padding: 0.22rem 0.55rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: var(--surface);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.32rem;
  }

  .about-hero__avatar-tag--link {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text-main);
    transition: color 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease, transform 200ms var(--ease-spring), box-shadow 200ms ease;
  }

  .about-hero__avatar-tag--link:hover,
  .about-hero__avatar-tag--link:focus-visible {
    color: var(--green);
    border-color: var(--green-border);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-xs);
  }

  .about-hero__avatar-piece {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    color: var(--green);
    margin-right: 0.05rem;
    transform: translateY(-0.5px);
  }

  .about-hero__avatar-arrow {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    transition: transform 200ms var(--ease-spring), color 160ms ease;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: block;
  }

  .about-hero__avatar-tag--link:hover .about-hero__avatar-arrow,
  .about-hero__avatar-tag--link:focus-visible .about-hero__avatar-arrow {
    color: var(--green);
    transform: translate(2px, -2px);
  }

  .about-hero__eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--green);
  }

  .about-hero__title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5.5vw, 3.4rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .about-hero__title-em {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--green);
  }

  .about-hero__lead {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 1.8vw, 1.15rem);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 36rem;
  }

  .about-hero__lead strong {
    color: var(--text-main);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* ─── STATS ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .about-stats {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.35rem 0 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(6rem, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem) clamp(1.25rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
    align-items: flex-end;
    border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--green) 22%, var(--border-soft));
    max-width: 54rem;
  }

  .about-stats__item--wide {
    grid-column: span 2;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .about-stats {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
    .about-stats__item--wide {
      grid-column: span 2;
    }
  }

  .about-stats__item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column-reverse;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-stats__item dt {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .about-stats__item dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
    color: var(--green);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .about-stats__place {
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.2vw, 1.4rem) !important;
    color: var(--text-main) !important;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  /* ─── SECTIONS NUMÉROTÉES ──────────────────────────────────── */
  .about-section {
    padding: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.5rem) 0;
  }

  .about-section__head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    padding-bottom: 0.65rem;
    max-width: 54rem;
  }

  .about-section__num {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 1.8rem);
    color: var(--green);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .about-section__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 3.5vw, 2.1rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .about-section__title em {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--green);
  }

  .about-section__body {
    max-width: 38rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .about-section__body p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.78;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .about-section__body p em {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--green);
  }

  .about-section__close {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.18rem !important;
    color: var(--green) !important;
    line-height: 1.4 !important;
    padding-left: 0.85rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--green);
    margin-top: 0.5rem !important;
  }

  /* ─── PULL QUOTE ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .about-section--quote {
    padding: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem) 0;
  }

  .about-quote {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem 1.75rem 2.5rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--green);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--green) 5%, var(--surface));
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
    max-width: 44rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .about-quote::before {
    content: "\201C";
    position: absolute;
    top: -0.4rem;
    left: 0.6rem;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 4rem;
    line-height: 1;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--green) 45%, transparent);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .about-quote p {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  /* ─── LISTE MÉTHODE ────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .about-method {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  .about-method li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 7.5rem 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--surface);
    transition: border-color 180ms ease, transform 180ms var(--ease-spring);
  }

  .about-method li:hover {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--green) 35%, var(--border-soft));
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .about-method__tag {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--green);
    padding: 0.18rem 0.45rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--green) 10%, var(--surface));
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    border: 1px solid var(--green-border);
    text-align: center;
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .about-method li > span:last-child {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .about-method li {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.45rem;
    }
  }

  /* ─── LISTE NÉGATIVE ───────────────────────────────────────── */
  .about-section--neg {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg-warm) 60%, var(--bg));
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  }

  .about-not {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    max-width: 42rem;
  }

  .about-not li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-main);
    padding: 0.4rem 0;
  }

  .about-not__mark {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: var(--green);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  /* ─── SIGN-OFF ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .about-signoff {
    padding: 2.5rem 0 0;
  }

  .about-signoff__inner {
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    max-width: 38rem;
  }

  .about-signoff__signature {
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .about-signoff__name {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.4rem);
    color: var(--text-main);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .about-signoff__name::after {
    content: "*";
    color: var(--green);
    margin-left: 0.05em;
  }

  .about-signoff__city {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .about-signoff__contact {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .about-signoff__contact--chess {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .about-signoff__mail {
    color: var(--green);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--green) 35%, transparent);
    transition: border-color 160ms ease;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .about-signoff__mail:hover {
    border-bottom-color: var(--green);
  }

  .about-signoff__ext {
    transition: transform 200ms var(--ease-spring);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transform: translateY(1px);
  }

  .about-signoff__mail:hover .about-signoff__ext {
    transform: translate(1px, 0);
  }

  /* ─── Animations reveal ───────────────────────────────────── */
  .about-page.js-anim .about-hero__grid,
  .about-page.js-anim .about-stats,
  .about-page.js-anim .about-section__head,
  .about-page.js-anim .about-section__body,
  .about-page.js-anim .about-quote,
  .about-page.js-anim .about-not,
  .about-page.js-anim .about-signoff__inner {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(14px);
    transition: opacity 720ms var(--ease-out), transform 720ms var(--ease-out);
  }

  .about-page.js-anim.is-loaded .about-hero__grid { transition-delay: 0ms; opacity: 1; transform : none; }
  .about-page.js-anim.is-loaded .about-stats { transition-delay: 120ms; opacity: 1; transform : none; }
  .about-page.js-anim.is-loaded .about-section__head { opacity: 1; transform : none; }
  .about-page.js-anim.is-loaded .about-section__body { opacity: 1; transform : none; }
  .about-page.js-anim.is-loaded .about-quote { opacity: 1; transform : none; }
  .about-page.js-anim.is-loaded .about-not { opacity: 1; transform : none; }
  .about-page.js-anim.is-loaded .about-signoff__inner { opacity: 1; transform : none; }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion : reduce) {
    .about-page.js-anim .about-hero__grid,
    .about-page.js-anim .about-stats,
    .about-page.js-anim .about-section__head,
    .about-page.js-anim .about-section__body,
    .about-page.js-anim .about-quote,
    .about-page.js-anim .about-not,
    .about-page.js-anim .about-signoff__inner {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  function activateAbout() {
    const el = document.querySelector(".about-page");
    if (!el) return;
    el.classList.add("js-anim");
    requestAnimationFrame(() => requestAnimationFrame(() => el.classList.add("is-loaded")));
  }
  if (document.readyState === "loading") {
    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", activateAbout, { once : true });
  } else {
    activateAbout();
  }
  document.addEventListener("astro:page-load", activateAbout);
</script>
